  "description": "A distributed job orchestration and billing platform for generative AI inference, facilitating media generation through models such as Flux and Stable Diffusion. It integrates a Rust-based API gateway with gRPC-driven worker nodes and a Stripe-backed credit system for multi-tenant monetization. The project utilizes Nix for reproducible environment provisioning and CUDA-accelerated Python runtimes to execute high-performance inference tasks.",
